      "mergedPostDetails": "I had to leave \"Tսppers Feet Fan Club\" group today, and it's not funny anymore. Seriously tho, there's too many VRChat clubs and events to follow around, and I've filled up 100 limit pretty quickly. At least make it a VRC+ perk 👉👈",
